{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/HeadwireCaptureModel\/documentation\/HeadwireCaptureModel\/FormatSelection\/preferred(in:cardPrefers:)"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/HeadwireCaptureModel\/documentation\/HeadwireCaptureModel","doc:\/\/HeadwireCaptureModel\/documentation\/HeadwireCaptureModel\/FormatSelection"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"preferred","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"in","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"formats","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"CaptureFormat","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireCaptureModel\/documentation\/HeadwireCaptureModel\/CaptureFormat","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20HeadwireCaptureModel0B6FormatV"},{"text":"], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"cardPrefers","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"card","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CardPreferredMode","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireCaptureModel\/documentation\/HeadwireCaptureModel\/CardPreferredMode","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20HeadwireCaptureModel17CardPreferredModeV"},{"text":"? = .none) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ResolvedFormat","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireCaptureModel\/documentation\/HeadwireCaptureModel\/ResolvedFormat","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20HeadwireCaptureModel14ResolvedFormatV"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Takes the card’s own preferred mode first, where the list offers it: its resolution and rate,","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"then its resolution, then its rate, s